  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using ViT as the image encoder (config_036) significantly improves performance compared to ResNet50. This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder with pca_n2000 in a multimodal multiprofile setup with ViT and avgpool/concat, isolating the RNA encoder's impact. It clarifies whether the RNA encoder choice (scvi_n200 vs pca_n2000) is critical when using high-performing image encoders, while maintaining consistency in other design choices."
